HIS HEALTH IS FAILING.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.619
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE LOTS OF RUMORS
ABOUT PRESIDENT PUTIN'S HEALTH

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:26.893
