ENTIRELY TOO HEALTHY.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:31.464
NOT A FORMAL INTELLIGENCE
JUDGMENT.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.767
&gt;&gt; DAVID SANGER IS THE CNN
POLITICAL NATIONAL SECURITY

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.770
ANALYST, NATIONAL SECURITY
CORRESPONDENT FOR "THE NEW YORK

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.839
TIMES."
DAVID, ALSO HERE IN ASPEN WITH

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.408
ME.
I WONDER, THERE HAS BEEN SO MUCH

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:45.078
SPECULATION ABOUT PUTIN'S
HEALTH, SOME BASED ON

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:48.715
PHOTOGRAPHS SHOWING A PUFFY
FACE, LOTS OF JUDGMENT FROM THE

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.751
OUTSIDE, NOT NECESSARILY BASED
ON HARD DATA.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.088
I WONDER IN YOUR VIEW AS THE CIA
DIRECTOR PUT THE HEALTH RUMORS

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:56.689
TO BED?
&gt;&gt; WELL, CERTAINLY THERE HAS

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:01.661
BEEN A BIG EFFORT, JIM, BY MANY
IN THE DIFFERENT INTELLIGENCE

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:08.001
AGENCIES TO DO EXACTLY THAT.
THE CONCLUSION YOU HEARD THERE

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:11.337
FROM THE CIA DIRECTOR, WHO, OF
COURSE, USED TO BE AN AMBASSADOR

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:16.142
TO RUSSIA AND KNOWS PUTIN WELL,
BILL BYRNES, IS COMPLETELY

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:19.913
CONSISTENT WITH WHAT WE'RE
HEARING FROM THE BRITISH, FROM

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.949
EUROPEAN INTELLIGENCE AGENCIES,
THEY DON'T BELIEVE THE RUMORS

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:27.353
THAT PUTIN HAS CANCER, THEY
DON'T BELIEVE THAT THE PUFFINESS

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:31.758
THAT THEY HAVE SEEN IS CAUSED BY
STEROIDS.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:36.029
AND IN FACT ALL THEIR
CONCLUSIONS ARE THAT FOR 69,

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:41.601
NEARLY 70-YEAR-OLD RUSSIAN MALE
HE'S DOING A LOT BETTER THAN

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.936
AVERAGE.
&gt;&gt; ANOTHER HEADLINE FROM THE CIA

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:49.075
DIRECTOR'S COMMENTS YESTERDAY
WAS HIS ASSESSMENT OF WHAT

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:53.379
PUTIN'S CALCULATION SEEMS TO BE,
THAT PUTIN AND BYRNES IS NOT THE

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:57.684
ONLY ONE WHO SAID THIS, BUT
PUTIN BELIEVES HE CAN WAIT NOT

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:02.488
JUST JAUKRAINE OUT, BUT WAIT TH
WEST OUT, HE CAN TAKE ADVANTAGE

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:06.259
OF, AS BYRNES DESCRIBED IT,
AMERICA'S ATTENTION DEFICIT

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:09.829
DISORDER, THAT IT WILL LOSE
INTEREST EVENTUALLY AND LOSE

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:14.801
POLITICAL SUPPORT.
I WONDER IS THAT SOMETHING YOU

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.504
HEAR FREQUENTLY AND IS THAT
SOMETHING THAT FOLKS IN THE UK

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:22.242
AND EUROPE AND THE U.S. FEAR AS
WELL?

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:25.378
&gt;&gt; IT CERTAINLY IS, JIM.
I THINK THE FACT THAT HE RAISED

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:30.049
IT SO CLEARLY WAS AN EFFORT BY
THE ADMINISTRATION TO WARN THAT

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:33.553
THIS IS PUTIN'S STRATEGY.
HE ALSO WENT ON TO SAY THAT HE

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:37.757
DOESN'T THINK IT WILL WORK, HE
THINKS THAT PUTIN MISCALCULATED

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:41.661
ABOUT UKRAINIAN AND NATO RESOLVE
EARLY ON WHEN HE DID THE ATTACK

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.397
AND HE WAS WRONG THEN, AND HE'S
WRONG NOW.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:49.035
BUT THERE ARE SOME PIECES OF
EVIDENCE ALONG THE WAY, FIRST OF

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:53.940
ALL, THE WAR HAS TURNED INTO
THAT GRINDING PHASE THAT I THINK

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.208
AMERICANS HAVE LOST SOME
ATTENTION.

00:02:56.208 --> 00:02:59.912
SECONDLY, EUROPEANS KNOW THAT
WINTER IS COMING, AND THAT

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:05.217
SUDDENLY THEY'RE GOING TO HAVE
TO THINK ABOUT RATIONING NATURAL

00:03:05.217 --> 00:03:09.789
GAS, AND PERHAPS OIL, THAT IS
GOING TO TAKE A TOLL.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:15.361
AMERICANS THOUGHT THAT THIS WAS
PRETTY COST FREE FOR THEM UNTIL

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:19.165
GAS MOVED UP TO $5, $6 A GALLON
AND WHILE IT IS COMING DOWN NOW,

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.133
IT MAY NOT COME DOWN FAST
ENOUGH.

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:24.637
AND, OF COURSE, THE PRESIDENT
HIMSELF HAS BLAMED THAT ON

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:27.307
PUTIN, EVEN THOUGH THERE ARE
OTHER FACTORS INVOLVED.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:30.510
SO ALL THOSE THINGS COULD
CONTRIBUTE, AND, LOOK, OUR OWN

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:36.415
HISTORY WITH AFGHANISTAN AND
IRAQ SUGGESTS AMERICANS DO HAVE

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.519
AN ATTENTION DEFICIT DISORDER
WHEN IT COMES TO FARAWAY

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:40.987
CONFLICTS.
&gt;&gt; YOU DO MAKE A GOOD POINT

00:03:40.987 --> 00:03:44.623
THERE, THOUGH, THAT DESPITE HIM
OFTEN BEING DESCRIBED AS TEN

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:49.662
FEET TALL, PUTIN IN HIS GREAT
WISDOM, HE'S BEEN WRONG MULTIPLE

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.699
TIMES IN THE PAST SEVERAL
MONTHS, UKRAINE'S ABILITY TO

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:58.237
