THE CIA DIRECTOR SAID THAT THE

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:03.008
U.S. ESTIMATE NOW OF RUSSIAN
LOSSES, 15,000 KILLED, SOME

00:04:03.008 --> 00:04:07.113
45,000 INJURED, THAT'S 60,000
AND IN MY EXPERIENCE, THE U.S.

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:09.949
ESTIMATE IS SOMEWHAT ON THE LOW
END OF THE SCALE COMPARED TO

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:13.586
