AGENCIES.

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:15.688
HOW LONG CAN RUSSIA WITHSTAND
THOSE LOSSES?

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.491
THOSE ARE THE PERSONNEL LOSSES.
WE ALSO KNOW THEY HAD ENORMOUS

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:21.427
