HARDWARE.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:24.797
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, THIS IS THE HUGE
QUESTION.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:29.402
PUTIN HAS RESISTED DOING A
GENERAL CONSCRIPTION.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:33.172
AND THE SOLDIERS WHO ARE BEING
KILLED, AND THAT'S A REMARKABLE

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:37.009
NUMBER, MORE THAN THREE TIMES
WHAT THE UNITED STATES LOST IN

00:04:37.009 --> 00:04:42.281
IRAQ AND AFGHANISTAN OVER, YOU
KNOW, 15, 20 YEARS, RIGHT, THE

00:04:42.281 --> 00:04:47.887
