LARGELY FROM POORER SECTIONS AND

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:53.993
OUTLYING SECTIONS OF RUSSIA,
THEY'RE NOT THE MIDDLE CLASS

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:57.063
KIDS FROM ST. PETERSBURG WHO,
